    {
      "snippet_id": "C-5_p5_p5_b3",
      "exhibit": "C-5",
      "page": 5,
      "text": "New attempts: It's the first time for world well- known optical brand to carry out in- depth cross- border cooperation with KOL in esports, and to launch integrated transmission project covering online and offline channels and lasting half a year; new methods: It broke through the conventional marketing methods of the industry to make use of the influence of KOL team members to accurately reach the target audiences and deepen the brand's influence among young people through hot search, hot word and high frequency interaction; new products: Considering different scene requirements, LUMEN Optics innovatively launched two different kinds of products as practical type and accessory type, including the practical- type LUMEN esports lens innovatively launched on the basis of the new scenes, provided the target audiences with practical solutions, and launched individual jointly- designed accessory- type glasses sets as per the properties of each KOL team member, which have been popular among young people; new thoughts: LUMEN Optics abandoned the repeated infusion of eye caring popularization knowledge, and made use of KOL team members' idol demonstration effect, to popularize knowledge of eye caring and protection, and to improve the attention of the whole people to eye health.",
